ard he  said that he invested in twitter because  he believes in the potential for free  speech around the globe and he believes  that free speech is societal imperative  for a functioning democracy but he now  realizes the company will neither thrive  nor serve this societal imperative in  its current form twitter needs to be  transformed as a private company as a  result he's offering to buy a hundred  percent of it for that fifty four  dollars and twenty cents per share his  offer is best and final and if not  accepted he would need to reconsider his  position as a shareholder twitter has  extraordinary potential and elon musk  believes he can unlock it but that's not  all we also have his text message here  where he texted and said as i indicated  this weekend i believe that the company  should be private to go through the  changes that need to be made after the  past several days of thinking this over  i have decided i want to acquire the  company and take it private i'm going to  send you an offer later tonight it will  be public in the morning are you  available to  chat sounds kind of like a you up text  and then lastly we can see that there's  a number of things that have been  outlined in some of the public documents  around this twitter acquisition you can  see here that he said this is his best  and final offer he's not playing the  back and forth game he has simply moved  straight to the end it's a high price  the twitter shareholders will love it  the deal doesn't work given that he  doesn't have confidence in management  and he doesn't believe that the public  market facilitates the necessary changes  he would need to reconsider his position  as a shareholder not a threat simply not  a good investment without the changes  that need to be made and those changes  won't happen without taking the company  private elon's advisors and his team  they're available to get you the letter  to answer any questions and there'll be  more detail in their public filings  that's exactly what i would expect from  the world's richest man this is  incredible to watch elon musk going ham  at twitter usually a lot of this types  of communications much more polished  done in a much more formal way elon's  just sitting there texting the chairman  of the twitter board it's filing things  publicly saying best and final let's go  straight to the end big dogs i got 43  billion dollars and i'm willing to spend  it to buy your company they offered him  a board seat he said no now he's gonna  try to buy the whole damn company this  is incredible and i gotta say this is  one of the most fun things to watch on  the internet right now i hope that elon  actually gets control of twitter it's  probably gonna be good for twitter it'll  probably be good for free speech i just  hope that elon doesn't get spread too  thin we still need elon to usher in  electric vehicles we need them to go  ahead and help settle mars and now elon  musk defender of free speech is just  another thing to add to his plate hey  you did you like this video great we  make five of them a day and post them  here on this channel make sure you  subscribe like the video and see you  next time
 

